(OBJECTIVE) Tj T*
(Exercise AMBER FIELD is a daylight site-security watch of two camera sectors.) Tj T*
(The operator reports unattended bags and any vehicle stopping in the car park.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(TIMES) Tj T*
(The watch runs from 09:00 to 09:30 local; the report is due at 09:35.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(LOCATIONS) Tj T*
(Sector 1 \(camera 1\): the car park, viewed from above.) Tj T*
(Sector 2 \(camera 2\): the tree-lined park avenue with benches.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PEOPLE AND UNITS) Tj T*
(One handheld operator. The range warden on duty is the safety officer.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(RESTRICTIONS) Tj T*
(Observe and report only; do not approach or stop anyone.) Tj T*
(Do not record identities of members of the public in reports.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(RESOURCES) Tj T*
(One handheld device and two fixed cameras, one per sector.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DEPENDENCIES) Tj T*
(The watch starts only when both cameras report a live feed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(RISKS) Tj T*
(Crowds on the park avenue can hide people; moving vehicles in the car park.) Tj T*
